  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion achieve high accuracy (0.713). This experiment tests whether the RNA-only setup with scvi_n200 and transformer aggregation (config_006) can match this performance, isolating the necessity of image data. It clarifies if the multimodal success relies on image modality or if RNA representation alone suffices, addressing a key design choice with minimal changes from previous high-performing configurations."
}

